{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00259",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.06,
      "end_seconds": 4.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Excuse me, doctor, should I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.97,
      "end_seconds": 8.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "You're fine, sit down. So, what brings you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.44,
      "end_seconds": 16.36,
      "duration_seconds": 6.92,
      "text": "So, I've been feeling lightheaded, doctor. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.44,
      "end_seconds": 21.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "When did you first notice it? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.51,
      "end_seconds": 31.15,
      "duration_seconds": 7.64,
      "text": "Ever since... since yesterday, really. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.67,
      "end_seconds": 36.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Alright. Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.54,
      "end_seconds": 46.81,
      "duration_seconds": 10.27,
      "text": "It's, It's moderate, honestly. Only sitting down, and it's not much. I notice it more with hot weather. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.33,
      "end_seconds": 50.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Anything that tends to go along with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.55,
      "end_seconds": 57.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.75,
      "text": "A pounding in the head goes along with it, most of the time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.5,
      "end_seconds": 61.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Does it happen all the time or in spells?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.36,
      "end_seconds": 64.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "It's once or twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.05,
      "end_seconds": 79.87,
      "duration_seconds": 14.82,
      "text": "I'll be straight with you about how this works. Most of what we see in clinic turns out to be manageable, and the history you give me is often more useful than any single test, so thank you for being so detailed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.38,
      "end_seconds": 84.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Thank you, uh, that really helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.15,
      "end_seconds": 89.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Have you had any slurred speech, chest pain or weakness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.03,
      "end_seconds": 94.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "No. None of those, uh, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.72,
      "end_seconds": 96.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "Any vomiting or palpitations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.58,
      "end_seconds": 101.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "No, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.93,
      "end_seconds": 105.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.24,
      "end_seconds": 106.94,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.25,
      "end_seconds": 120.85,
      "duration_seconds": 5.6,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.06,
      "end_seconds": 133.29,
      "duration_seconds": 11.23,
      "text": "Losartan. I take it 50 milligrams, once a day for my blood pressure. I'm on glimepiride, 2 milligrams, maybe, before breakfast for my sugar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.2,
      "end_seconds": 136.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Is the packet here, or the prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.07,
      "end_seconds": 139.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "No, it's at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.76,
      "end_seconds": 141.71,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.17,
      "end_seconds": 143.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "I've never smoked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.63,
      "end_seconds": 145.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.27,
      "end_seconds": 150.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "I gave up drinking about three years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.68,
      "end_seconds": 153.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.29,
      "end_seconds": 155.2,
      "duration_seconds": 0.91,
      "text": "No allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.59,
      "end_seconds": 160.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.7,
      "end_seconds": 169.44,
      "duration_seconds": 7.74,
      "text": "Oh, I have high blood pressure, for about ten years. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.91,
      "end_seconds": 170.86,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "Okay. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.51,
      "end_seconds": 176.97,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "text": "Oh, yes, diabetes. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.32,
      "end_seconds": 184.09,
      "duration_seconds": 5.77,
      "text": "Yes, I can see the diabetes in your file as well. What about operations, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.68,
      "end_seconds": 193.92,
      "duration_seconds": 9.24,
      "text": "Yes, I had my tonsils out, when I was a child. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.47,
      "end_seconds": 197.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Let me check your vitals now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.63,
      "end_seconds": 212.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Hold still for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.39,
      "end_seconds": 239.25,
      "duration_seconds": 5.86,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 99 percent, pulse 93, blood pressure 100 over 62, respiratory rate 17."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.99,
      "end_seconds": 241.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.35,
      "end_seconds": 244.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.06,
      "end_seconds": 250.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.6,
      "end_seconds": 253.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Now bend it for me, slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.32,
      "end_seconds": 270.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "Heart rhythm is regular."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.31,
      "end_seconds": 294.65,
      "duration_seconds": 18.34,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. So, based on the history and the examination, it fits best with postural low blood pressure. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.21,
      "end_seconds": 299.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Is it something serious, uh, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.57,
      "end_seconds": 316.6,
      "duration_seconds": 17.03,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like postural low blood pressure, but I'd like to confirm. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been feeling lightheaded, since yesterday, moderate, and no chest pain or slurred speech."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.14,
      "end_seconds": 319.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Yes, uh, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.68,
      "end_seconds": 325.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Let me know if I'm going too fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.42,
      "end_seconds": 327.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "No, you're fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.78,
      "end_seconds": 349.11,
      "duration_seconds": 20.33,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a blood sugar test for dizziness. Get up in stages, sit on the edge of the bed for a minute first, and keep drinking water. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 349.5,
      "end_seconds": 351.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Okay, uh, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 352.26,
      "end_seconds": 366.26,
      "duration_seconds": 14.0,
      "text": "I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse. Let's review you in two weeks. Alright, just to confirm, what are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 367.4,
      "end_seconds": 371.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "So, I come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 371.87,
      "end_seconds": 376.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. We're all set. Don't leave without asking if something's unclear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 376.82,
      "end_seconds": 380.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "So, that's everything I wanted to ask. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 382.18,
      "end_seconds": 383.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.16,
      "text": "See you then."
    }
  ]
}